// Invariant B: Growth scores are derived from Living Regions + networks only.
// Invariant C: Intercity links never mutate canonical network capacity directly.
// Invariant D: Specialization phases mirror LR sector evidence with hysteresis.
// Invariant E: Derived events are emit-only; V10.14 does not consume its own outputs.
// Invariant F: Guardian warnings are information-only.
// Invariant G: Feature off → null state, zero runtime cost in turn pipeline.
// Invariant H: Bounded catalogs (40 cities, 160 links).
// Invariant I: Deterministic recompute from input hash.
// Invariant J: Pre-V10.14 saves start with empty memory.

